72 720 Td
(.4. INT. DOWNTOWN CAIRO EDIT SUITE  -  LATER) '
(Layla compares the source fragment against the final master. Facial landmarks drift by three pixels. The voiceprint is clean where breath should live.) '
(LAYLA) '
(The warning was removed, then the mouth was rebuilt around a new sentence.) '
(Noor searches the production records. JULIAN VOSS appears under two incompatible corporate histories. Neither proves which person controls the delivery.) '
(NOOR) '
(Same name. Different cities. No reliable identifier.) '
(She marks JULIAN VOSS: IDENTITY UNRESOLVED.) '
(Owen sends a release slate from the New York screening room. The typography, color field, and title arrangement match a smaller documentary campaign already circulating under WITNESS PROTOCOL.) '
(OWEN \(ON SCREEN\)) '
(Julian copied their title card and premiere identity. The venue thinks our film is the authorized continuation.) '
(NOOR) '
(Do you have the original campaign source?) '
(OWEN) '
(Only screenshots. The archive page is gone.) '
(Another title appears in an old folder: BORROWED FACE. The file has no author, date, or rights note.) '
(LAYLA) '
(Undated. Unowned. It proves nothing.) '
(Noor builds a short evidence packet, separating verified files from assumptions.) '
(NOOR) '
(Witness Protocol is severe, but screenshots are not enough. We return it for more evidence.) '
(Owen nods and runs toward the venue archive.) '
ET
endstream
endobj
