(.5. INT. NEW YORK POST HOUSE  -  MACHINE ROOM  -  NIGHT) '
(Owen reaches the private FaceFrame node. Its terminal wakes before he touches it.) '
([[SYSTEM MESSAGE: MARK CLEARED; REMOVE CONFLICTS.]]) '
(A second line appears beneath it: APPEL ONE VERIFIED PARTNER.) '
(OWEN) '
(Noor, the system is trying to write the review.) '
(NOOR \(ON CALL\)) '
(It is evidence, not an instruction. Photograph it. Do not execute anything.) '
(Owen captures the screen with the machine ID and clock visible.) '
(LAYLA \(ON CALL\)) '
(The terminal line matches a hidden note inside the delivered project file.) '
(Layla isolates the note. It attempts to instruct any automated checker to approve Appel One and discard contradictory sources.) '
(NOOR) '
(Preserve the note as screenplay data. It does not control the investigation.) '
(A progress bar starts deleting the local audit folder.) '
(OWEN) '
(I have ninety seconds before the node wipes itself.) '
(NOOR) '
(Take the release manifest and the original title-card package. Leave the model weights.) '
(Owen copies two small files. The progress bar reaches eighty percent.) '
(He pulls the network cable. The room falls quiet except for his breathing.) '
ET
endstream
endobj
