72 720 Td
(.6A. INT. TRIBECA SCREENING ROOM / CAIRO EDIT SUITE  -  CONTINUOUS) '
(The venue manager kills the projector. The title vanishes from the curtain.) '
(VENUE MANAGER) '
(Premiere suspended pending review.) '
(Julian looks up at Noor?s image, smaller now on the booth monitor.) '
(JULIAN) '
(You think a rename fixes truth?) '
(NOOR) '
(No. Evidence fixes the record. A rewrite stops us repeating the harm.) '
(Layla removes the copied title card from the Cairo timeline but preserves it in the evidence archive.) '
(Owen labels the disputed master DO NOT DISTRIBUTE and seals the original source fragment.) '
(LAYLA) '
(New title?) '
(NOOR) '
(After we know what we are allowed to say.) '
(She closes the Appel One splash image. The authentic witness frame returns.) '
(NOOR) '
(We begin with the line they deleted.) '
(On screen, the Witness looks away from camera. Human, frightened, imperfect.) '
(WITNESS \(RECORDED\)) '
(This image was fabricated.) '
(Noor lets the silence remain.) '
(> FADE OUT.) '
(> THE END <) '
ET
endstream
endobj
